---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Instructions - Axiomet"
  description=""
>
<section class="section"><div class="section-gap"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="instruction-wrapper"><div class="instruction-header"><h1 class="hero-heading">Instruction</h1><div class="instruction-p-wrap"><p class="instruction-paragraph">GSAP Animation Setup &amp; Usage Guide for Axiomet Template — step-by-step integration and practical usage</p></div></div><div class="instruction-main"><p class="instruction-p">1. Open Site Settings → Custom Code → Footer Code (before &lt;/body&gt; tag). GSAP and ScrollTrigger must be enabled in Site Settings → GSAP for the counter animation.<br/>2. Paste the code below:</p><div data-to-top-6s="true" class="instruction-content-block"><pre contenteditable="false" class="instruction-code-block w-code-block" style="display:block;overflow-x:auto;background:#2b2b2b;color:#f8f8f2;padding:0.5em"><code class="language-javascript" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span><span>&lt;!-- =====================================================
</span></span><span>  AXIOMET TEMPLATE — CUSTOM CODE
</span><span><span>  </span><span class="hljs-attr">Location</span><span>: Site Settings → Custom Code → Footer Code
</span></span><span>  (before &lt;/body&gt; tag)
</span><span>
</span><span><span>  </span><span class="hljs-attr">Includes</span><span>:
</span></span><span><span>  </span><span style="color:#f5ab35">1.</span><span> Lenis Smooth Scroll
</span></span><span><span>  </span><span style="color:#f5ab35">2.</span><span> Counter Animation (GSAP + ScrollTrigger)
</span></span><span>====================================================== --&gt;
</span><span>
</span><span>
</span><span>&lt;!-- =====================================================
</span><span><span>  </span><span style="color:#f5ab35">1.</span><span> LENIS SMOOTH SCROLL
</span></span><span>  Adds smooth scrolling to the whole site.
</span><span><span>  Remove </span><span style="color:#f5ab35">this</span><span> block to use </span><span style="color:#dcc6e0">default</span><span> browser scrolling.
</span></span><span>====================================================== --&gt;
</span><span><span></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">link</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a"> </span><span class="xml hljs-attr" style="color:#ffa07a">rel</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">=</span><span class="xml" style="color:#abe338">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a"> </span><span class="xml hljs-attr" style="color:#ffa07a">href</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">=</span><span class="xml" style="color:#abe338">&quot;https://unpkg.com/lenis@1.3.1/dist/lenis.css&quot;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml">
</span></span><span><span class="xml"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a"> </span><span class="xml hljs-attr" style="color:#ffa07a">src</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">=</span><span class="xml" style="color:#abe338">&quot;https://unpkg.com/lenis@1.3.1/dist/lenis.min.js&quot;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;/</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml">
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">  </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> lenis = </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">new</span><span class="xml javascript"> Lenis(&#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">    </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">smoothWheel</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">true</span><span class="xml javascript">,     </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// smooth mouse-wheel scrolling</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">    </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">lerp</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">0.1</span><span class="xml javascript">,             </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// smoothness (lower = smoother)</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">    </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">wheelMultiplier</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">1</span><span class="xml javascript">,    </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// scroll speed</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">    </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">infinite</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">false</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span>  &#125;);
</span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">  </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function" style="color:#dcc6e0">function</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function"> </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function" style="color:#00e0e0">raf</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">(</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function" style="color:#f5ab35">time</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">) </span><span class="xml javascript">&#123;
</span></span><span>    lenis.raf(time);
</span><span>    requestAnimationFrame(raf);
</span><span>  &#125;
</span><span>
</span><span>  requestAnimationFrame(raf);
</span><span><span class="xml javascript"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;/</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml">
</span></span><span>
</span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#d4d0ab">&lt;!-- =====================================================
</span></span><span>  2. COUNTER ANIMATION (GSAP + ScrollTrigger)
</span><span>  Counts numbers up from 0 when they scroll into view.
</span><span>  How to use: add the custom attribute data-counter
</span><span>  to any text element that contains a number
</span><span>  (e.g. 120+, 98%, 3.5x, 1,200).
</span><span><span class="xml" style="color:#d4d0ab">====================================================== --&gt;</span><span class="xml">
</span></span><span><span class="xml"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">  </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">window</span><span class="xml javascript">.Webflow ||= [];
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">  </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">window</span><span class="xml javascript">.Webflow.push(</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">() =&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript"> &#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">    </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">document</span><span class="xml javascript">.querySelectorAll(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;[data-counter]&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">).forEach(</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">(</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function" style="color:#f5ab35">counter</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">) =&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript"> &#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// Animate the first text node (the number),</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// so a trailing &lt;span&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; is left alone</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> textNode = [...counter.childNodes].find(
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">        </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">(</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function" style="color:#f5ab35">n</span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">) =&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript"> n.nodeType === </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">3</span><span class="xml javascript"> &amp;&amp; n.textContent.trim()
</span></span><span>      );
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> textEl = textNode || counter.firstElementChild || counter;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> original = textEl.textContent.trim();
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// Split into prefix, number and suffix (e.g. &quot;$&quot;, &quot;1,200&quot;, &quot;+&quot;)</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> match = original.match(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#ffa07a">/^([^0-9.-]*)([0-9.,-]+)(.*)$/</span><span class="xml javascript">);
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">if</span><span class="xml javascript"> (!match) </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">return</span><span class="xml javascript">;
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> prefix = match[</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">1</span><span class="xml javascript">];
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> number = match[</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">2</span><span class="xml javascript">].replace(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#ffa07a">/,/g</span><span class="xml javascript">, </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">);
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> suffix = match[</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">3</span><span class="xml javascript">];
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> target = </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">parseFloat</span><span class="xml javascript">(number);
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">if</span><span class="xml javascript"> (</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">Number</span><span class="xml javascript">.isNaN(target)) </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">return</span><span class="xml javascript">;
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> hasDecimal = number.includes(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;.&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">);
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> hasComma = original.includes(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;,&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">);
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">const</span><span class="xml javascript"> value = &#123; </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">current</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">0</span><span class="xml javascript"> &#125;;
</span></span><span>
</span><span>      gsap.fromTo(
</span><span>        value,
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">        &#123; </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">current</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">0</span><span class="xml javascript"> &#125;,
</span></span><span>        &#123;
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">          </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">current</span><span class="xml javascript">: target,
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">          </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">duration</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">1.8</span><span class="xml javascript">,           </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// animation length in seconds</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">          </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">ease</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;power2.out&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">,
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">          </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">scrollTrigger</span><span class="xml javascript">: &#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">            </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">trigger</span><span class="xml javascript">: counter,
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">            </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">start</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#abe338">&quot;top 88%&quot;</span><span class="xml javascript">,      </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#d4d0ab">// starts when the number enters the viewport</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">            </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">once</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">true</span><span class="xml javascript">
</span></span><span>          &#125;,
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">          </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-attr">onUpdate</span><span class="xml javascript">: </span><span class="xml javascript hljs-function">() =&gt;</span><span class="xml javascript"> &#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">            </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">let</span><span class="xml javascript"> formattedValue = hasDecimal
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">              ? value.current.toFixed(</span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">1</span><span class="xml javascript">)
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">              : </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">Math</span><span class="xml javascript">.floor(value.current);
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="xml javascript">            </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#dcc6e0">if</span><span class="xml javascript"> (hasComma &amp;&amp; !hasDecimal) &#123;
</span></span><span><span class="xml javascript">              formattedValue = </span><span class="xml javascript" style="color:#f5ab35">Number</span><span class="xml javascript">(formattedValue).toLocaleString();
</span></span><span>            &#125;
</span><span>
</span><span>            textEl.textContent = prefix + formattedValue + suffix;
</span><span>          &#125;
</span><span>        &#125;
</span><span>      );
</span><span>    &#125;);
</span><span>  &#125;);
</span><span><span class="xml javascript"></span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&lt;/</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">script</span><span class="xml" style="color:#ffa07a">&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></section>

<section data-wf-component-id="07cabb84-e213-7b3e-d5b9-9874f0825eb3" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section cta"><img data-parallax="true" loading="lazy" alt="Row of server racks with status lights in a dimly lit data centre" src="/images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db.webp" sizes="(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px" srcset="/images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db-p-500.webp 500w, /images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db-p-800.webp 800w, /images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/6ac4fe7566afb39c00ba4009_0c2b0a53f3013034f902ff8455d90c5218f2a1db.webp 2400w" class="cta-image"/><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="cta-item-wrap"><div class="max-width-50"><h2 class="section-heading large center">Have a complex problem? Let&#x27;s work through it.</h2></div><div class="cta-button-wrapper"><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="bg-white" data-wf-component-id="4c762986-7cae-1c12-bec9-1ecbb760ee61" data-wf-variant-state="21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4" href="/contact-v1" class="primary-button w-variant-21f200ea-2927-6f93-7fe0-867acd69adf4 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="button-text is-one">Start a Project</div><div class="button-text is-two">Start a Project</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="transparent" data-wf-component-id="4c762986-7cae-1c12-bec9-1ecbb760ee61" data-wf-variant-state="ed894e25-3305-bbf3-ed58-552251f78472" href="/case-study-v1" class="primary-button w-variant-ed894e25-3305-bbf3-ed58-552251f78472 w-inline-block"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="button-text is-one">Explore Our Work</div><div class="button-text is-two">Explore Our Work</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M15.8333 12.5002H9.99992H3.33325L3.33325 5.8335V5.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12.5 16.6668L16.6667 12.5002L12.5 8.3335" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></div><div class="cta-overlay"></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
